      "writtenOn": "2018-10-02T17:35:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Platform provides a common interface to generate resources, GEM Port ID/Alloc ID, etc, based on specific hardware.\nGiven ONUs of multiple vendors are connected to a PON port will the OLT support multiple platform objects/instances existing at the same time?",
      "range": {
